Today, we are covering the
series finale of Seinfeld.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:24.990
I was never a huge Seinfeld fan,

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:26.520
so I haven't seen that many episodes,

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:29.230
